  unitName: Unflinching Themis
  unitId: 50414
  unitNumber: 543
  description: A genius sorceress from the La Veda Republic, known to have invaded
    the Bariura Empire by herself to prove her talents. There she was captured by
    the knight Magress and threatened repeatedly, though eventually expelled from
    the empire in one piece. While she was scared to tears on the inside, she is
    said to have been kicking and screaming the entire way to the border. Some even
    say that Magress was so impressed with her bravado that he personally shielded
    her from his empire's dark magicians.
  summonDesc: I wish someone powerful<br>would summon me.<br>Get what I mean?
  fusionDesc: I'm not done yet!<br>Bring me more!<br>More power!
  evoDesc: Make me strong enough<br>to beat him... Then<br>I'll do anything you want!
  element: 5
  rarity: 4
